text = "Crystal? I'm not sure what you mean. I know the cave we're heading to is supposed to have some.
You seem troubled, you might consider also taking a break before we continue?
(THIS IS THE END OF THE PLAYTEST, THANKS FOR GETTING THIS FAR! FEEL FREE TO USE YOUR KNOWLEDGE TO DISCOVER ANY SECRETS.

ALSO, you should be able to select levels from the main menu now.)"
